        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Image Composition with Depth Registration</title>\n    <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n    <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        body {\n            font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ff8c00 0%, #ff6600 15%, #ffffff 15%, #ffffff 100%);\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff8c00 0%, #ff6600 100%);\n            padding: 20px 40px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .header::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -50%;\n            right: -10%;\n            width: 400px;\n            height: 400px;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n        }\n        .header-content {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        .logo {\n            font-size: 48px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: white;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n        }\n        .header-text {\n            text-align: right;\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .header-text .main {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n        .header-text .sub {\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n        .star {\n            position: absolute;\n            right: 150px;\n            top: 30px;\n            color: white;\n            font-size: 30px;\n        }\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 40px;\n            background: white;\n        }\n        .title {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .title h1 {\n            font-size: 36px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .title h2 {\n            font-size: 28px;\n            font-weight: normal;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .title .authors {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .title .conference {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n        .title .contact {\n            font-size: 14px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        .two-column {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n        }\n        .left-column {\n            flex: 1;\n        }\n        .right-column {\n            flex: 1;\n        }\n        .section {\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n        }\n        .section-title {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #d32f2f;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #d32f2f;\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n        .section-content {\n            font-size: 13px;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n        .image-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 8px;\n            margin: 15px 0;\n        }\n        .image-placeholder {\n            background: #e0e0e0;\n            border: 1px solid #999;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 10px;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #666;\n            min-height: 80px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n        .method-diagram {\n            margin: 15px 0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .method-diagram img {\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 500px;\n        }\n        .placeholder {\n            background: #f0f0f0;\n            border: 1px solid #ccc;\n            padding: 10px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n            text-align: center;\n            color: #666;\n            font-size: 12px;\n        }\n        .result-images {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);\n            gap: 5px;\n            margin: 15px 0;\n        }\n        .result-images .image-placeholder {\n            min-height: 60px;\n            font-size: 9px;\n        }\n        .comparison-table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin: 15px 0;\n            font-size: 10px;\n        }\n        .comparison-table th,\n        .comparison-table td {\n            border: 1px solid #999;\n            padding: 4px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .comparison-table th {\n            background: #e0e0e0;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        .chart-placeholder {\n            background: #f5f5f5;\n            border: 1px solid #999;\n            height: 200px;\n            margin: 15px 0;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: #666;\n        }\n        .footer {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff8c00 0%, #ff6600 100%);\n            height: 80px;\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .footer::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: -20px;\n            right: 0;\n            width: 0;\n            height: 0;\n            border-left: 200px solid transparent;\n            border-bottom: 100px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n        .footer::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 10px;\n            right: 50px;\n            width: 150px;\n            height: 150px;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) 0%, transparent 70%);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\n            <div class=\"logo\">ISCAS</div>\n            <div class=\"header-text\">\n                <div class=\"main\">中国科学院软件研究所学术年会 2023</div>\n                <div class=\"sub\">暨计算机科学国家重点实验室开放周</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"star\">❋</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"title\">\n            <h1>Image Composition with Depth Registration</h1>\n            <h2>基于深度注册的嵌入式图像合成</h2>\n            <div class=\"authors\">李赞、王文成、侯飞</div>\n            <div class=\"conference\">International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence(IJCAI-2023)</div>\n            <div class=\"contact\">联系人：李赞，18810762067，lizhan@ios.ac.cn</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"two-column\">\n            <div class=\"left-column\">\n                <div class=\"section\">\n                    <div class=\"section-title\">背景</div>\n                    <div class=\"section-content\">\n                        图像合成是指将不同图像中的内容融合为一张\n看似真实的图像，它在广告设计和影片合成等领域主要是指\n色彩、阴影和光度的自然生成，对于图像内容之\n间位置相关关系研究不多，往往需要模拟的手动或\n理间效率不高。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"image-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(a)目标图像</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(b)源图像</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(c)第一次合成</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(d)第二次合成</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(e)第三次合成</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(f)深度伪合成</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"section\">\n                    <div class=\"section-title\">方法</div>\n                    <div class=\"section-content\">\n                        本文提出新的方法，从源图像中选择要嵌入目\n标图像中的内容，根据源内容与目标图像的深度注\n册，将源内容嵌入目标图像所表达的一维空间中。\n具体，用户输入作为条件来控制训练 GAN 方法\n的摆放时，融合处理可基于图像内容的深度方位\n置偏差和 z 间隙来定义损失函数。这样关系合理\n处理的合成图像，其处理步骤如下：\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"section-content\">\n(a)基于深度学习方法进行源图像和目标图像的深\n度估计，一维空间化；<br>\n(b)基于深度注册初始化，将源内容嵌入目标图像\n所表达的一维空间中；<br>\n(c)迭代进行图像中剩序度的调整，以优化深度注\n册，具备可靠的伪合成结果。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"placeholder method-diagram\">[方法流程图]</div>\n\n                <div class=\"section\">\n                    <div class=\"section-title\">深度注册:</div>\n                    <div class=\"section-content\">\n(a)深度缩放:在放至目标图像中,并调整其大小使得其\n与目标图像中的一个内容具有相似尺度;<br>\n(b)深度平移:将图像中内容的深度沿前后的位置予源\n内容的输出位置(一般来说选择目标内容的有序\n序列中位值小的点作为结点);<br>\n(c)根据相机内参数缩放,是立深度校准大小之间\n的关系;<br>\n(d)用序能缩编组设定深源内容的位置、大小后,\n根据上述关系计算源内容像素的深度，完成深\n度注册。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"image-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(a)输入</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(b)深度注册</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(c)插点</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"section\">\n                    <div class=\"section-title\">分割 / 深度的优化调整:</div>\n                    <div class=\"section-content\">\n(a)深度恢复:在分割掩码上估计图像语义,进行更细致合\n理的分割,如分割并修子质上的帽子等;<br>\n(b)深度优化:根据编辑操作建立的关系,更新\n源内容的位置、尺寸,以进近合理放置。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"section\">\n                    <div class=\"section-title\">实验结果</div>\n                    <div class=\"section-content\">\n                        本方法可逐步优化深度注册，使源内容更合\n理嵌入目标图像对应的一维空间; 方便图像合成\n的编辑技术进一步，而非像传统方法手动调整需多个\n源图像内容的位置时，只有第一次较入需要进行\n深度优化处理，较交互次数能，进一步提升丹背景\n变通图像内容的位置，则无需更多的调整：反观\n常用的Photoshop方法,每次放入深度需处理手\n动定位用户交互。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"placeholder chart-placeholder\">[折线图: Composition orders vs 交互次数]</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"right-column\">\n                <div class=\"section-content\" style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                    本方法所得到合成结果，与基于深度学习的\nCompGAN方法、传统Tan的方法相比，能合理处理嵌\n入关系。与PhotoShop方法相比，台减用户交互。结果\n我们所演的同异相和交互次数相隔。\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"result-images\">\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果1]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果2]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果3]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果4]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果5]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果6]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果7]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果8]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果9]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果10]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果11]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果12]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果13]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果14]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果15]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果16]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果17]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果18]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果19]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果20]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果21]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果22]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果23]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果24]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果25]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果26]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果27]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果28]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果29]</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">[结果30]</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"image-grid\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(a)源图像</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(b)目标图像</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(c)CompGAN</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(d)Tan的方法</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(e)PS</div>\n                    <div class=\"image-placeholder\">(f)我们的方法</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"section-content\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">\n                    对于上图的八个例子，我们用准确率和F1分数来定\n量源内容在合成图像中具有正确嵌述特标签的像素占比，\n结果见表所示:\n                </div>\n\n                <table class=\"comparison-table\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>CompGAN</th>\n                        <th colspan=\"2\">Accuracy</th>\n                        <th colspan=\"2\">F1 score</th>\n                        <th>CompGAN</th>\n                        <th colspan=\"2\">Accuracy</th>\n                        <th colspan=\"2\">F1 score</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th></th>\n                        <th>Ours</th>\n                        <th>Ours*</th>\n                        <th>Ours</th>\n                        <th>Ours*</th>\n                        <th></th>\n                        <th>Ours</th>\n                        <th>Ours*</th>\n                        <th>Ours</th>\n                        <th>Ours*</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row1</td>\n                        <td>0.2340</td>\n                        <td>0.5943</td>\n                        <td>1.0000</td>\n                        <td>0.9626</td>\n                        <td>Row5</td>\n                        <td>0.6623</td>\n                        <td>0.8526</td>\n                        <td>1.0000</td>\n                        <td>0.8542</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row2</td>\n                        <td>0.5365</td>\n                        <td>0.5963</td>\n                        <td>1.0000</td>\n                        <td>0.9671</td>\n                        <td>Row6</td>\n                        <td>0.4447</td>\n                        <td>0.5810</td>\n                        <td>1.0000</td>\n                        <td>0.8648</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row3</td>\n                        <td>0.5232</td>\n                        <td>0.5786</td>\n                        <td>1.0000</td>\n                        <td>0.9791</td>\n                        <td>Row7</td>\n                        <td>0.3335</td>\n                        <td>0.7731</td>\n                        <td>1.0000</td>\n                        <td>0.9756</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row4</td>\n                        <td>0.3337</td>\n                        <td>0.3337</td>\n                        <td>1.0000</td>\n                        <td>0.9756</td>\n                        <td>Row8</td>\n                        <td>0.4107</td>\n                        <td>0.5353</td>\n                        <td>1.0000</td>\n                        <td>0.8742</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td>0.9094</td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td>0.9236</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <div class=\"section-content\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">\n                    可以看到我们的方法在各项指标中都是最好的。\n表中，Ours* 表示用用在优化策略的结果，可看我们只有\n一个内容要嵌入目标像点时，基本不需要优化步骤;当\n和PhotoShop相提来的结果。如下表所示, 本方法平均\n比Photoshop方法快4倍多，所需交互次数也少很多。\n                </div>\n\n                <table class=\"comparison-table\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th></th>\n                        <th colspan=\"2\">Photoshop</th>\n                        <th colspan=\"2\">Ours</th>\n                        <th>Improvement</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th></th>\n                        <th>Time(s)</th>\n                        <th>#I</th>\n                        <th>Time(s)</th>\n                        <th>#I</th>\n                        <th>%</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row1</td>\n                        <td>142.0s</td>\n                        <td>71</td>\n                        <td>33.0s</td>\n                        <td>3</td>\n                        <td>4.3x</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row2</td>\n                        <td>158.6s</td>\n                        <td>82</td>\n                        <td>36.3s</td>\n                        <td>3</td>\n                        <td>4.4x</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row3</td>\n                        <td>147.8s</td>\n                        <td>68</td>\n                        <td>39.1s</td>\n                        <td>3</td>\n                        <td>3.8x</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row4</td>\n                        <td>166.0s</td>\n                        <td>93</td>\n                        <td>34.4s</td>\n                        <td>5</td>\n                        <td>4.8x</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row5</td>\n                        <td>145.3s</td>\n                        <td>77</td>\n                        <td>38.6s</td>\n                        <td>2</td>\n                        <td>3.8x</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row6</td>\n                        <td>158.7s</td>\n                        <td>93</td>\n                        <td>35.9s</td>\n                        <td>2</td>\n                        <td>4.4x</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row7</td>\n                        <td>133.0s</td>\n                        <td>82</td>\n                        <td>35.0s</td>\n                        <td>4</td>\n                        <td>3.8x</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Row8</td>\n                        <td>152.0s</td>\n                        <td>93</td>\n                        <td>38.1s</td>\n                        <td>4</td>\n                        <td>4.0x</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Average</td>\n                        <td>150.5s</td>\n                        <td>82</td>\n                        <td>36.3s</td>\n                        <td>3.25</td>\n                        <td>4.1x</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <div class=\"section\">\n                    <div class=\"section-title\">结论</div>\n                    <div class=\"section-content\">\n                        本文提出的深度注册方法，促进了嵌入式图像合成的\n方位高效实现，降低了图像内容制作门槛，将提高电影\n、动画和艺术创作领域的工作效率。\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\"></div>\n</body>\n</html>"
